        "key_terms": ["organelles", "parts", "functions", "cell"],
        "source_span": "Inside a cell there are many different parts, and each part has its own job to do. These parts are called organelles. Just like the organs in your body each have a function \u2014 your heart pumps blood, your lungs help you breathe \u2014 the organelles inside a cell each perform a specific function that keeps the cell alive and working properly."
    },
