        "concept": "Cell_Membrane",
        "key_terms": ["cell membrane", "outer layer", "protect", "control"],
        "source_span": "The cell membrane. This is the thin outer layer that surrounds the cell. Its job is to protect the cell and to control what substances are allowed to enter or leave."
